WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:10.000
Wenn es um jüdische Geschichte und Rückkehr geht: Wie verstehst Du deine jüdische und israelische
Identität?

00:12.300 --> 00:14.566
It’s funny to say "the people from Europe",

00:14.566 --> 00:18.433
because firstly, there were people here,

00:18.433 --> 00:20.266
my family was here.

00:21.800 --> 00:23.700
About 20 generations

00:23.700 --> 00:26.300
I counted already, about 20 generations.

00:26.300 --> 00:30.133
So my family was here...

00:30.133 --> 00:35.033
Jews were not parachuted into the Middle East.

00:35.766 --> 00:37.766
Me myself for example

00:37.766 --> 00:40.100
I'm a huge mixture of Middle East,

00:40.100 --> 00:44.466
I have Yemenite roots and Libyan...

00:44.700 --> 00:48.000
Moroccan and Israeli...

00:48.000 --> 00:50.466
From this region...

00:51.566 --> 00:52.600
And...

00:53.900 --> 00:57.033
My husband for example,

00:57.033 --> 01:01.500
his parents are from Tunisia and Egypt and...

01:01.633 --> 01:04.300
If you take my children today,

01:04.533 --> 01:08.500
you see this mix of ethnicities,

01:09.133 --> 01:10.300
where should we go?

01:11.133 --> 01:12.800
it’s so funny,

01:13.466 --> 01:14.566
that...

01:15.100 --> 01:16.733
people around the world say

01:16.833 --> 01:18.433
"The UN gave Israel ..."

01:18.466 --> 01:22.233
or "the British gave Israel to the Jews",

01:22.233 --> 01:24.200
or "the Balfour Declaration".

01:24.433 --> 01:26.833
but what gave us the land of Israel

01:26.833 --> 01:28.600
Now listen, all of those are really nice things,

01:28.600 --> 01:32.566
is winning the wars against our neighbors,

01:32.833 --> 01:37.233
which we paid a lot of blood for.

01:37.233 --> 01:39.400
So that what, end of the day

01:39.400 --> 01:42.600
because you can recognize a country,

01:42.600 --> 01:45.000
people are now recognizing the Palestinian state.

01:45.200 --> 01:47.033
Is it here?

01:47.266 --> 01:50.100
You need to fight for your place.

01:50.133 --> 01:52.600
That's what we did, that's what we did.

01:52.700 --> 01:54.933
That's what gave us

01:54.933 --> 01:57.800
the right to stay here,

01:57.800 --> 01:59.133
because otherwise

01:59.133 --> 02:02.433
we would have just ended up like the Yezidis

02:02.433 --> 02:04.033
or the Copts...

02:04.033 --> 02:05.000
or the Kurds.
